{"id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md","title":"Sato-Tate Conjecture","display":"df-sato-tate-conjecture — Sato-Tate Conjecture","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sato-tate-conjecture","aliases":["58-df-sato-tate-conjecture"],"display":"df-sato-tate-conjecture — Sato-Tate Conjecture","depends_on":["[[58-df-elliptic-curve]]","[[58-df-prime-number]]","[[58-df-complex-multiplication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sato-tate-conjecture"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sato-tate-conjecture</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sato-tate-conjecture — Sato-Tate Conjecture"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"58-df-elliptic-curve\">58-df-elliptic-curve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"58-df-prime-number\">58-df-prime-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"618616f65f4acd32\" href=\"?note=618616f65f4acd32\" title=\"58-df-complex-multiplication\">58-df-complex-multiplication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CM}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{CM}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E/\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(E/\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span> (elliptic curve)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (prime of good reduction for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_E(p)\">\\(a_E(p)\\)</span> (trace of Frobenius)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_p\">\\(\\theta_p\\)</span> (Frobenius angle)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq[0,\\pi]\">\\(A\\subseteq[0,\\pi]\\)</span> (Borel set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\">\\(\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_E(p)\">\\(a_E(p)\\)</span> are the algebraic-geometric good-reduction predicate and Frobenius trace attached to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S\\)</span> are metatheoretic predicates because this dependency closure does not construct reduction or point-counting objects</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\)</span> and the metatheoretic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CM}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the cited elliptic-curve and complex-multiplication atoms</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}frobenius\\text{-}angle} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S(E,p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\land\\theta\\in[0,\\pi]\\land a_E(p)=2\\sqrt p\\cos\\theta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}frobenius\\text{-}angle} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S(E,p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\land\\theta\\in[0,\\pi]\\land a_E(p)=2\\sqrt p\\cos\\theta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate\\text{-}conjecture} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,K_E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0\\leq a&lt;b\\leq\\pi\\to\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{p\\leq x:\\exists\\theta\\;(\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S(E,p,\\theta)\\land a\\leq\\theta\\leq b)\\}|}{|\\{p\\leq x:\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\}|}\n=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_a^b\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate\\text{-}conjecture} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,K_E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0\\leq a&lt;b\\leq\\pi\\to\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{p\\leq x:\\exists\\theta\\;(\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S(E,p,\\theta)\\land a\\leq\\theta\\leq b)\\}|}{|\\{p\\leq x:\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\}|}\n=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_a^b\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the non-CM distribution. Elliptic curves with complex multiplication have a different Sato–Tate measure.</li>\n<li>The turnstiles are marked metatheoretic rather than pretending that good reduction, Frobenius traces, and complex multiplication have set-level definitions in the present dependency closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-elliptic-curve","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elliptic-curve]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-prime-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"618616f65f4acd32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-multiplication]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CM}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"E/\\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"a_E(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_p","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq[0,\\pi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)","display":false},{"tex":"a_E(p)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}frobenius\\text{-}angle} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S(E,p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\land\\theta\\in[0,\\pi]\\land a_E(p)=2\\sqrt p\\cos\\theta","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate\\text{-}conjecture} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,K_E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0\\leq a<b\\leq\\pi\\to\n\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{p\\leq x:\\exists\\theta\\;(\\operatorname{FrobeniusAngle}_S(E,p,\\theta)\\land a\\leq\\theta\\leq b)\\}|}{|\\{p\\leq x:\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReduction}_S(E,p)\\}|}\n=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_a^b\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":2434,"backlinks":[{"id":"0dcb67ff541ccfe3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8ba4c92bb4d3383e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)$ is the registered metatheoretic non-CM Sato--Tate predicate, including good reduction and Frobenius-angle data (see [[58-df-sato-tate-conjecture]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md|58-df-sato-tate-conjecture]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["74f4744df7db749f","dad686059f3ca152","618616f65f4a